$DATUM 2-(Benzo[d][1,3]dioxol-5-yl)-5H-isoquinolino[1,2-b]quinazolin-8(6H)-one
(28). A mixture of quinazolone 27 (50 mg, 0.15 mmol), cesium carbonate
(100 mg, 0.31 mmol), benzo[d][1,3]dioxol-5-ylboronic acid (51 mg, 0.31
mmol), and bis(tri-tert-butylphosphine)-palladium(0) (0.8 mg, 0.002 mmol)
in degassed 1,4-dioxane (0.8 mL) was heated at 90 °C for 3 h. The
reaction was cooled to room temperature and filtered through a pad of
celite. The filtrate was concentrated under reduced pressure and purified
by flash chromatography eluting with CH2Cl2 to provide 53 mg (94%) of
quinazolone 28 as a cream colored solid.
2-(Benzo[d][1,3]dioxol-5-yl)-5H-isoquinolino[1,2-b]quinazolin-8(6H)-one
(28), yield 53 mg, 94% mp 220-221 °C; 1H NMR (500 MHz) δ 8.65 (d, J = 1.5
Hz, 1 H), 8.33 (dd, J = 8.0, 1.0 Hz, 1 H), 7.81-7.75 (comp, 2 H), 7.63
(dd, J = 8.0, 1.5 Hz, 1 H), 7.47 (ddd, J = 8.0, 7.0, 1.5 Hz, 1 H), 7.33
(d, J = 8.0 Hz, 1 H), 7.18-7.16 (comp, 2 H), 6.92 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 1 H),
6.03 (s, 2 H), 4.44 (t, J = 6.5 Hz, 2 H), 3.13 (t, J = 6.5 Hz, 2 H); 13C
NMR (125 MHz) δ 161.8, 149.3, 148.3, 147.8, 147.4, 140.5, 135.6, 134.6,
134.3, 130.1, 129.9, 128.0, 127.7, 126.9, 126.6, 126.3, 120.83, 120.78,
108.7, 107.7, 101.3, 39.7, 27.2; IR (neat) 2896, 1669, 1477, 1239, 1038,
773 cm-1; mass spectrum (CI) m/z 369.1239 [C23H17N2O3 (M+1) requires
369.1239].
