$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Methyl 4,4′′-didecyloxy-2,2′:5′,2′′-terthiophene-3′-acetate (TThMA)
2,5-Dibromothiophene-3-acetic acid methylester (1.72 g, 5.0 mmol) was
dissolved in 1,2- dimethoxyethane (34 ml) followed by addition of K2CO3
solution (1M, 17 ml) and Pd(PPh3)4 (516 mg, 0.45 mmol) with stirring.
3-decyloxy thiophene-2-boronicacid addition was done in lots and first
lot (4.0 g, 4.1 mmol) was done initially. After stirring for 4 hrs at
80°C, more boronic acid (750 mg, 2.6 mmol) was added. Reaction was
stirred for additional 2 hours maintaining the temperature. Only 2 main
spots were observed on monitoring the reaction by TLC. Dichloromethane
(50 ml) was added on cooling the reaction and separating the organic from
the bottom. On extracting the contents again with dichloromethane (50
ml), combining the organic and drying on MgSO4 and removing the solvent
on rotary evaporator gave the crude. This was purified on silica column
(1′x14″) eluting with hexane: dichloromethane (7: 3) resulting the clear
separation of bright yellow coloration impurity first, followed by yellow
band resulting the product on solvent evaporation (3.17 g, 94%). mp
35-35.4ºC. 1H NMR (400 MHz) δ 7.06 (s, 1H, H4'); 6.86 (d, 1H, J = 1.7 Hz,
H3); 6.83 (d, 1H, J = 1.7 Hz, H3''); 6.23 (d, 1H, J = 1.7 Hz, H5); 6.12
(d, 1H, J = 1.7 Hz, H5''); 3.94 (m, 4H, 2OCH2), 3.73 (2H, -CH2COOCH3),
3.725 (3H, -CH2COOCH3) 1.80-0.86 (16CH2, 2CH3). 13C NMR (100.6 MHz) δ
171.1, 157.6, 136.2, 135.0, 133.3, 132.5, 130.6, 126.3, 119.0, 116.2,
98.0, 96.5, 70.1, 52.2, 34.6, 31.9. IR (KBr) ν max/cm-1 2920 (s), 2851
(s), 1736 (s), 1722 (s), 1565 (s), 1533 (s), 1471 (s), 1452 (s), 1417
(s), 1371 (s), 1332 (m), 1216 (s), 1199 (s), 1170 (s), 1263 (m), 1170
(s), 1051 (s), 1029 (s), 962 (w), 894 (w), 883 (w), 867 (w), 812 (s), 740
(s), 719 (s), 676 (s), 613 (s), 563 (s), 477 (w). Anal.calcd. for
C35H52O4S3: C, 66.41; H, 8.28; S, 15.20. Found: C, 65.69; H, 8.54; S,
14.99. MS m/e (relative intensity, %): 631 (4), 632 (M+ 100), 633 (43),
634 (24), 635 (8). HRMS Calcd. for C35H52O4S3, 632.30278. Found:
632.30263. Electronic spectrum (CH2Cl2) λ maxnm/(logε) 354 (4.41), 257
(4.13).
