$DATUM 2,2-Bis(4''-(1,3-dioxolan-2-yl)-3',4'-dihexyl-2,2':5',2''-terthiophen-2-yl)propane
(S11): A solution of dibromide S10 (975 mg. 2.66 mmol), boronic acid
ester S5 (4.138 g, 7.98 mmol), K2CO3 (1.495 g, 10.8 mmol) and Pd(PPh3)4
(200 mg, 0.173 mmol) in THF/toluene/water (3/3/1, 35mL) was heated to
refluxed and stirred for 2 days. After cooling to room temperature, water
(20 mL) was added to the reaction mixture. The aqueous layer was
extracted with diethyl ether (3 × 40 mL). The combined organic extracts
were washed with water (1 × 20 mL) and brine (1 × 20 mL), then dried over
anhydrous Na2SO4. After filtration and removal of solvent in vacuo, the
crude product was purified by column chromatography (silica gel,
EtOAc/n-hexane = 1/6) to give product. Yield:93% (2.526 g), yellow oil.
1H-NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.35 (m, 2H), 7.14 (d, J= 1.3 Hz, 2H), 6.92 (d,
J= 3.7 Hz, 2H), 6.83 (d, J= 3.7 Hz, 2H), 5.88 (s, 2H), 4.12-4.00 (m, 8H),
2.67-2.64 (m, 8H), 1.88 (s, 6H), 1.56-1.50 (m, 8H), 1.43-1.26 (m, 24H),
0.90-0.86 (m, 12H); 13C-NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3): δ 154.86, 140.29, 140.24,
139.74, 137.30, 134.50, 130.36, 129.29, 125.01, 124.30, 123.55, 123.20,
100.43, 65.13, 40.60, 32.79, 31.48, 31.46, 30.72, 30.64, 29.55, 29.50,
28.12, 28.11, 22.62, 22.58, 14.06, 14.05; HRMS (ESI-Orbitrap): m/z calcd
for C57H76O4S6Na, 1039.3960; found, 1039.3967 ([M+Na]+).
