$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 4-Amino-5-(furan-2-yl)-2-methyl-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[ 2,3-d]pyrimidine (9a). An argon-purged
mixture of 26 (305 mg, 0.75 mmol), furan-2-boronic acid (126 mg, 1.125
mmol), Na2CO3 (239 mg, 2.25 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (8 mg, 0.036 mmol), and TPPTS
(53 mg, 0.093 mmol) in water/MeCN (2:1, 5 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3
h. After cooling, the mixture was neutralized using aq HCl (1 M) and
concentrated to dryness in vacuo, and the residue was purified by reverse
phase HPFC (C-18, 0→ 100% MeOH in water) to afford product 9a as a beige
solid, which was crystallized from water/MeOH. 4-Amino-2-methyl-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-5-(thiophen-3-yl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (9d).
Compound 9d was prepared as described for 9a from 26 (305 mg, 0.75 mmol)
and thiophene-3-boronic acid as beige solid (253 mg, 93%), which was
crystallized from waterto give beige needles. Mp 179-181 °C. [α ]D -62.6
(c 0.305, DMSO). 1H NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d6): 2.40 (s, 3H, CH3); 3.53 (ddd,
1H, Jgem = 12.0 Hz, J5´ a,OH = 6.2 Hz, J5´ a,4´ = 3.7 Hz, H-5´a); 3.62
(bdt, 1H, Jgem = 12.0 Hz, J5´ b,OH = J5´ b,4´ = 3.8 Hz, H-5´b); 3.91
(btd, 1H, J4´ ,5´a = J4´,5´b = 3.7 Hz, J4´ ,3´ = 2.7 Hz, H-4´); 4.09 (td,
1H, J3´ ,2´ = J3´,OH = 4.8 Hz, J3´ ,4´ = 2.7 Hz, H-3'); 4.49 (td, 1H, J2´
,1´ = J2´,OH = 6.6 Hz, J2´ ,3´ = 5.2 Hz, H-2'); 5.14 (d, 1H, JOH,3´ = 4.6
Hz, OH-3´); 5.30 (d, 1H, JOH,2´ = 6.6 Hz, OH-2´); 5.37 (bt, 1H, JOH,5´a =
JOH,5´b = 5.4 Hz, OH-5´); 6.04 (d, 1H, J1´ ,2´ = 6.7 Hz, H-1'); 6.16 (bs,
2H, NH2); 7.26 (dd, 1H, J4,5 = 4.9 Hz, J4,2 = 1.3 Hz, H-4-thienyl); 7.44
(s, 1H, H-6); 7.49 (dd, 1H, J2,5 = 2.9 Hz, J2,4 = 1.3 Hz, H-2-thienyl);
7.70 (dd, 1H, J5,4 = 4.9 Hz, J5,2 = 2.9 Hz, H-5-thienyl). 13C NMR (125.7
MHz, DMSO-d6): 25.36 (CH3); 62.12 (CH2-5´); 71.08 (CH-3'); 73.65 (CH-2');
85.53 (CH-4´); 87.37 (CH-1´); 99.02 (C-4a); 111.04 (C-5); 121.00 (CH-6);
121.97 (CH-2-thienyl); 127.56 (CH-5-thienyl); 128.62 (CH-4-thienyl);
135.09 (C-3-thienyl); 151.64 (C-7a); 157.46 (C-4); 160.41 (C-2). IR
(ATR): ν 1627, 1554, 1469, 1425, 1308, 1130, 1080, 1054, 1008, 980, 856,
788, 609 cm-1. MS (ESI) m/z 363 (M+H), 385 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI) for
C16H19N4O4S [M+H] calcd: 363.11215; found: 363.11088. Anal.
(C16H18N4O4S•1.2H2O): C, H, N.
