$DATUM 10-(Benzofuran-2-yl)-3-phenyl-6,7-dihydro-1H-pyrimido[6,1-a]isoquinoline-2,4(3H,11bH)-dione
(16). A mixture of bromide 15 (31 mg, 0.08 mmol), cesium carbonate (55
mg, 0.17 mmol), benzofuran-2-ylboronic acid (27 mg, 0.17 mmol), and
bis(tri-tert-butylphosphine) palladium(0) (0.5 mg, 0.001 mmol) in
degassed toluene (1.1 mL) was heated at 90 °C for 3 h. The reaction was
cooled to room temperature and filtered through a pad of celite. The
filtrate was concentrated under reduced pressure and purified by flash
chromatography eluting with hexanes/EtOAc (6 : 4) to provide 31 mg (92%)
of 16 as a white solid.
10-(Benzofuran-2-yl)-3-phenyl-6,7-dihydro-1H-pyrimido[6,1-a]isoquinoline-2,4(3H,11bH)-dione
(16), yield 31 mg, 92% mp 240-241 °C (colorless crystals from i-PrOH); 1H
NMR (400 MHz) δ 7.76-7.72 (comp, 2 H), 7.60 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 1 H), 7.53
(d, J = 8.4 Hz, 1 H), 7.51-7.40 (comp, 3 H), 7.34-7.23 (comp, 5 H), 7.03
(s, 1 H), 5.11 (dd, J = 13.6, 3.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.67 (ddd, J = 7.2, 4.4, 4.4
Hz, 1 H), 3.40 (dd, J = 16.8, 3.6 Hz, 1 H), 3.22-3.06 (comp, 2 H),
2.95-2.87 (comp, 2 H); 13C NMR (100 MHz) δ 168.4, 154.9, 153.6, 135.6,
134.6, 134.2, 129.8, 129.6, 129.2, 129.0, 128.7, 128.5, 124.6, 124.1,
123.1, 121.9, 121.0, 111.2, 101.6, 50.8, 40.9, 40.4, 29.1; IR (neat)
3061, 2924, 1723, 1676, 1432, 1249, 751, 698 cm-1; mass spectrum (ESI)
m/z 409.1552 [C26H21N2O3 (M+1) requires 409.1552].
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
